,"quotes":[{"c":"TECK 2019 Q2","e":"teck","d":"2019-07-25","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Donald R. Lindsay","x":"By streaming this data to the cloud and applying advanced analytics techniques, we are increasing our ability to identify truck underperformance, or poor road quality, and other factors in near-real time.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/25/teck-resources-limited-teck-q2-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"TECK 2019 Q2","e":"teck","d":"2019-07-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Donald R. Lindsay","x":"In addition to RACE21, in light of economic uncertainty and trade tensions, we are actively evaluating further cost reduction initiatives which can be implemented quickly in the event that commodity markets turn against us.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/25/teck-resources-limited-teck-q2-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"TECK 2019 Q2","e":"teck","d":"2019-07-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Andrew Milner","x":"And some of our other initiatives are in analytics in the mining environment -- haul cycle analytics, mining analytics, etc. There'll be cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/25/teck-resources-limited-teck-q2-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"TECK 2019 Q2","e":"teck","d":"2019-07-25","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Donald R. Lindsay","x":"I do want to highlight, though, that as we've reduced the guidance, that the bulk of the tonnage that's within the reduction is the lower margin products.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/25/teck-resources-limited-teck-q2-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"TECK 2019 Q3","e":"teck","d":"2019-10-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Matthew Korn","x":"I'll pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/24/teck-resources-ltd-teck-q3-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"TECK 2019 Q3","e":"teck","d":"2019-10-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Donald R. Lindsay","x":"We've also implemented a company wide cost reduction program to reduce spending on our capital and operating costs through 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/24/teck-resources-ltd-teck-q3-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"TECK 2019 Q3","e":"teck","d":"2019-10-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Donald R. Lindsay","x":"Our target cost reductions, do not include initiatives that would result in a reduction in the production volumes of our commodities or that could adversely affect the health and safety of our people and Ron will speak to our cost reduction program in further detail a little later.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/24/teck-resources-ltd-teck-q3-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"TECK 2019 Q3","e":"teck","d":"2019-10-24","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Donald R. Lindsay","x":"Looking forward, we have lowered our full year guidance for refined zinc production at Trail operations to 275,000 tons to 285,000 tons.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/24/teck-resources-ltd-teck-q3-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"TECK 2019 Q4","e":"teck","d":"2020-02-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Donald R. Lindsay","x":"And fourth, we are starting to see the benefits of the companywide cost reduction program that we announced in Q3 of 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/21/teck-resources-ltd-teck-q4-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"TECK 2019 Q4","e":"teck","d":"2020-02-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Donald R. Lindsay","x":"And Ron Millos will speak to our cost reduction programs in further detail a little later.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/21/teck-resources-ltd-teck-q4-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"TECK 2020 Q1","e":"teck","d":"2020-04-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Donald R. Lindsay","x":"And taking into account both the cost savings and the higher average pricing for Elkview coal because it is higher quality and then assuming USD150 per tonne of coal pricing and current exchange rates, this strategic move should translate to an annual increase in our EBITDA of approximately…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/21/teck-resources-ltd-teck-q1-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"TECK 2020 Q1","e":"teck","d":"2020-04-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Donald R. Lindsay","x":"We have increased our target for total reductions under our cost reduction program to CAD1 billion from previously planned spending through the end of 2020, and we have achieved CAD375 million in capital operating cost reductions to date since starting the program in the fourth quarter of 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/21/teck-resources-ltd-teck-q1-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"TECK 2020 Q2","e":"teck","d":"2020-07-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Donald R. Lindsay","x":"We are shifting to a lower cost base due to a declining strip ratio, also due to the Elkview plant expansion, which was completed, due to the Cardinal River closure, and as well as our cost reduction and RACE21 programs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/24/teck-resources-ltd-teck-q2-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"TECK 2020 Q2","e":"teck","d":"2020-07-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Donald R. Lindsay","x":"We also continue to focus on our cost reduction program.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/24/teck-resources-ltd-teck-q2-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"TECK 2020 Q3","e":"teck","d":"2020-10-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Donald R. Lindsay","x":"We've also made progress in reducing costs throughout the supply chain improvements and our cost reduction program and as a result of RACE21.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/27/teck-resources-ltd-teck-q3-2020-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"TECK 2020 Q3","e":"teck","d":"2020-10-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Donald R. Lindsay","x":"We are continuing to successfully restructure our cost base, due to our planned decline in strip ratio and due to the Elkview plant expansion and due to the closure of our Cardinal River Operations, as well as our cost reduction program CRP and our RACE21 programs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/27/teck-resources-ltd-teck-q3-2020-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"TECK 2020 Q3","e":"teck","d":"2020-10-27","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Donald R. Lindsay","x":"And we have lowered our guidance for our net cash unit costs in the second half of 2020 to $0.30 to $0.40 per pound from previously $0.40 to $0.50 per pound, so that's definitely headed the right direction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/27/teck-resources-ltd-teck-q3-2020-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"TECK 2020 Q3","e":"teck","d":"2020-10-27","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Donald R. Lindsay","x":"We've lowered our guidance for adjusted operating costs in the second half of the year to CAD35 to CAD38 per barrel bitumen down from the previous CAD37 to CAD40 per barrel.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/27/teck-resources-ltd-teck-q3-2020-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"TECK 2020 Q4","e":"teck","d":"2021-02-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Donald R. Lindsay","x":"We will continue to prioritize available spot sales volumes to China, which is expected to result in favorable price realization.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/18/teck-resources-ltd-teck-q4-2020-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"TECK 2020 Q4","e":"teck","d":"2021-02-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Donald R. Lindsay","x":"We exceeded our target for our cost reduction program.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/18/teck-resources-ltd-teck-q4-2020-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"TECK 2020 Q4","e":"teck","d":"2021-02-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Donald R. Lindsay","x":"…strip ratios, which we've highlighted and is part of the plan; we have the benefits of our cost reduction program; and then also RACE21 initiatives in innovation. Sales were at the upper end of the Q4 2020 guidance range at 6.1 million tonnes, with nearly 20% of sales to Chinese customers,","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/18/teck-resources-ltd-teck-q4-2020-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"TECK 2021 Q1","e":"teck","d":"2021-04-28","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Donald R. Lindsay","x":"The pipeline right-of-way and platform development is now essentially complete, and we continue with trenching, pipe streaming, welding and placement of the pipelines.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/29/teck-resources-ltd-teck-q1-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"TECK 2021 Q2","e":"teck","d":"2021-07-27","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Donald R. Lindsay","x":"Our transportation cost supported CAD2 per ton were above our full year guidance range, which was expected and higher than a year ago as a result of higher fuel surcharges and tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/27/teck-resources-ltd-teck-q2-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"TECK 2021 Q2","e":"teck","d":"2021-07-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Donald R. Lindsay","x":"We saw a significant improvement in our financial results in the second quarter, reflecting spot price increases in all of our key commodities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/27/teck-resources-ltd-teck-q2-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"TECK 2021 Q2","e":"teck","d":"2021-07-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Donald R. Lindsay","x":"We have noted increases in the cost of certain key supplies including mining equipment, fuel, tires and explosives, driven largely by price increases for underlying commodities such as steel, crude oil and natural gas.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/27/teck-resources-ltd-teck-q2-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"TECK 2021 Q2","e":"teck","d":"2021-07-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Real Foley","x":"It will be running at above 18.5 million tonnes of capacity and as such, delivering the cost savings that we're expecting to see going forward for the long term.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/27/teck-resources-ltd-teck-q2-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"TECK 2021 Q2","e":"teck","d":"2021-07-27","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Donald R. Lindsay","x":"For full-year, total cash unit costs in copper and zinc and adjusted site cash cost of sales in steelmaking coal and we have lowered our guidance for net cash unit costs in zinc.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/27/teck-resources-ltd-teck-q2-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"TECK 2021 Q2","e":"teck","d":"2021-07-27","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Robin B. Sheremeta","x":"I walked through that really we've got to get through this fire situation and see how we come out the other side, but we tried to reflect that in the guidance of 25 million to 26 million, so we did reduce the guidance by about half a million, so that's pretty much the issue.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/27/teck-resources-ltd-teck-q2-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"TECK 2021 Q3","e":"teck","d":"2021-10-27","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Shehzad Bharmal","x":"And as Robin said in copper, Don mentioned earlier in spite of the pressures, we have been able to maintain our guidance both in copper and zinc to be within our previous guidance as we work through efficiency gains and find new ways to reduce consumption, when pricing is so high and we've been…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/27/teck-resources-ltd-teck-q3-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"